Subject: [PATCH 2/5] server: preserve NOERROR for successful empty DNS polls

Do not rewrite successful polls to NXDOMAIN when no QUIC payload is
available. Return an empty NOERROR response while preserving genuine
decode errors.

Initialize the packet-preparation result for response slots without a
QUIC connection, avoiding an uninitialized return value.
